{
  "name": "Google review request after an appointment",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google review request after an appointment\n\n**What it does**\nWhen an appointment in your Google Calendar ends, it waits 2 hours, checks your log so a client is never asked twice, then sends one short review request: by SMS if the event has a phone number, by email otherwise. Each request is logged so nobody is asked twice.\n\n**You need**\nGoogle Calendar, Google Sheets, Twilio and Gmail credentials, and your Google review link.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Book clients as event guests, and put their mobile in the event description as `Phone: +15555550123` if you want SMS.\n2. Create a `Review requests` tab with headers: sent_at, name, email, phone, channel, event\n3. Fill in the yellow notes (calendar, review link, Twilio number, sheet ID) and activate.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "d997e52e-a9be-5cde-b69d-4cf7507256ca",
      "name": "Google review request after an appointment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nPick the calendar. Events are skipped when they have no guest, are cancelled, or have `internal` or `no review` in the title.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "545d2803-a9ed-523d-bc41-52954a4ee52a",
      "name": "Edit me: calendar and filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nGet your link in Google Business Profile (Ask for reviews) and put it in **Settings**, with your business name. Set the Twilio *From* number and rewrite both messages in your voice.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "5d97e2fd-ddc4-50f4-807b-52c312fcfd26",
      "name": "Edit me: review link and messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
